// !! ⌄ ⌄ ⌄ ⌄ ⌄ ⌄ ⌄ ⌄ ⌄ ⌄ ⌄ ⌄ ⌄ ⌄ ⌄ ⌄ ⌄ ⌄ ⌄ ⌄ ⌄ ⌄ ⌄ ⌄ ⌄ ⌄ ⌄ ⌄ ⌄ ⌄  //

/// One recorded event emission. `listenerCount` snapshots the subscriber count
/// at emission time; `payload` is the JSON-normalized payload, NULL when the
/// emitter sent none. The event catalog lives in memory (EventCatalogService);
/// only emissions are persisted.
model EventEmission {
  id            Int      @id @default(autoincrement())
  eventKey      String
  payload       Json?
  listenerCount Int      @default(0)
  emittedAt     DateTime @default(now())

  @@index([eventKey, emittedAt])
  @@index([emittedAt])
  @@schema("module/event-emitter")
}
